Install the Basic Memory marketplace and plugin into Claude Code (user-level).
claude plugin marketplace add /home/runner/work/_temp/basic-memory --scope user
claude plugin install basic-memory@basicmachines-co --scope user
Adding marketplace…✔ Successfully added marketplace: basicmachines-co (declared in user settings)
Installing plugin "basic-memory@basicmachines-co"...✔ Successfully installed plugin: basic-memory@basicmachines-co (scope: user)
Basic Memory plugin installed. Restart Claude Code and run /basic-memory:bm-setup.
Its skills call the Basic Memory MCP server; connect it if you have not: claude mcp add basic-memory -- uvx --prerelease=allow basic-memory mcp
The hooks run through uv; install uv first if it is not already on PATH.
